  "details": "When the (request) invite notification came while I was AFK (for example, sleeping, taking a bath, or eating), the time it took for the notification to disappear was so short that I didn't notice it.\n\nIt's very frustrating when someone goes to the trouble of sending an (request) invite and I don't notice it and can't reply.\n\nPlease keep the in-menu notification visible until I reply, dismiss, or restart.\n\nThis does not apply to \"new\" markings.",
